        "heading": "Who are the main buyers and markets for Oracle Health Government Services?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs is the top buyer for Oracle Health Government Services, obligating $1.3B in FY2026 to date. Computer Systems Design Services is the largest market for Oracle Health Government Services at $1.3B, with smaller obligations in Computer Facilities Management Services at $3.6M and Used Household and Office Goods Moving at $110K; Administrative Management and General Management Consulting Services shows $0."
